  "description": "Service Fabric readiness for Entity Framework contexts: each context must connect, a Firebird context must find every relation and column its model maps, and a context with migrations must have none pending (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2427).",
  "id": "Eternet.AspNetCore.ServiceFabric.EntityFrameworkCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-26T18:28:14.947Z",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "KHmoipGcPVMWWAAtPyZPQQssKTbjRwoukytQs2wN7fzpj/Nb5EtcoG4sq9zz/6LaVATfxeDaIcHdF5LpyetUbA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 113680,
  "published": "2026-11-26T18:25:34.6Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1: published with ServiceFabric 10.11.0 (1.2.0 was never published). 1.2.0: the application's background services start only once the instance is ready, so its jobs never run against a schema readiness has not verified (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2823). 1.1.2: a role with no schema in its search_path still verifies its schema-qualified relations. 1.1.0: a PostgreSQL context must find every relation and column its model maps, from EF migrations or reviewed scripts (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2777).",
